| `wiki-layer-ontology#/naming-law` (`:151-157`) | instance mounts "MUST NOT enter `@catalog`" | the host draft doc registers in the catalog as `wikis/{slug}/drafts/{DID}` (`wiki-mint-handlers.ts:48-66`, `open-vessel-core.ts:317`) | contradicts the code |
